    "updated_at": "2021-10-13T13:27:41Z",
    "body": "The original explainer was here: https://github.com/camillelamy/explainers/blob/master/coi-with-popups.md but it is now a bit outdated, I'll work on updating it. Opener policies are valid only on top-level documents, and will be discarded for subframes. Cross-origin isolation is therefore identical for an entire page - COOP does not matter for subframes, and they have to set COEP or simply wouldn't load.",
